[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘！\r\n『W.I.N.G.』への出場が決まったぞ！",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "004",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001070010,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ほ、ホントに！？\r\nうち、『W.I.N.G.』に出場できるん！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400107/7004001070010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\n間違いない、ちゃんと通知もきてる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001070020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "本当だ……\r\nプロデューサー、うち……うち……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400107/7004001070020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001070030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "やっ……たー！！",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400107/7004001070030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、やったな！\r\n俺も恋鐘と一緒にここまでこれて嬉しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最初のころはやる気が空回りすることもあったが\r\n今では逆にそれを武器にできてる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何があっても元気で諦めなかった恋鐘だからこそ\r\nここまで来れたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おめでとう、恋鐘！\r\n大したもんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001070040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "えへへ～、ありがとー!",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400107/7004001070040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001070050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "けど、大したもんなんはうちだけじゃなかよ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400107/7004001070050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001070060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "プロデューサーがうちの全力に\r\n全力でついてきてくれたから……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400107/7004001070060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001070070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ううん……うちの隣でいつも応援してくれたから\r\nここまで来れたばい！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400107/7004001070070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001070080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちと二人三脚でここまできたプロデューサーも\r\nばり大したもんたい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400107/7004001070080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、ありがとう、恋鐘",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけど、『W.I.N.G.』出場はゴールじゃない\r\nむしろここからが新しいスタートだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ここからは、より一層気を引き締めないとな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001070090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "わかっとるよー！\r\nこれから『W.I.N.G.』に向けて猛特訓して……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400107/7004001070090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001070100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そして、目指すはただ一つ……\r\n優勝あるのみたい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400107/7004001070100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、その意気だ！\r\n一緒に頑張って優勝しような",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001070110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん！　待っとってよ『W.I.N.G.』！\r\nうちとプロデューサーで絶対に優勝しちゃるけんねー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400107/7004001070110"
  },
